      <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>Every recording says which drive, folder or recorder it came from, and a Sunday recorded in two places is two rows rather than one.</li><li>After publishing: keep the files, move them to the Trash, or delete them.</li><li>A recording copied off a recorder is removed once its export has published; that folder is now "Network Transfers".</li><li>Anything under "All files on your drives" can be hidden.</li><li>A recorder only skips the file on the card it is writing to, so a finished service on the other card shows up.</li></ul>]]></description>
